Regionaldatenbank Deutschland attribution

The bundled reviewed demographic snapshot contains observations derived from
Regionaldatenbank Deutschland tables 12411-07-01-4 (BEV519 mean age),
12411-08-01-4 (BEV216 youth dependency quotient), 12411-01-01-4 (population at
31 December), 11111-01-01-4 (FLC006 district area), and 12411-05-01-4 (BEV028
annual-average population). Runtime adapters retrieve the same sources.
Population density and incidence are derived in regionalepi through their
separate validated contracts.

Modified by regionalepi: selected reviewed tables, years, and district rows;
normalized identifiers and field names; population density is derived by
regionalepi.

